      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5272,
      "text": "Nūn[1]. By the pen and what they [i.e., the angels] write [in the Records of deeds],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5273,
      "text": "By the grace of your Lord [O Prophet], you are not a madman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5274,
      "text": "You will surely have a never-ending reward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 564,
      "ruku": 498,
      "hizbQuarter": 226,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5275,
      "text": "Indeed, you are of a great moral character.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 68,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَلَمِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qalam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pen",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
